# Anna Whitaker, fashionista. Package A1 "The Duck": JobAccepted(duck), duck_returned, told_anna_duck_dead, anna_angry.

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('anna_angry')
goto: Angry

cond: HasFlag('duck_returned')
goto: Thankful

cond: HasFlag('told_anna_duck_dead')
goto: Grieving

cond: HasItem('synth_duck_item')
goto: HasDuck

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(duck)')
goto: Waiting

cond: true
goto: DefaultIntroduction

%rec: Nodes

name: Exit
npc: Come back soon!
effect: EndConversation

name: DefaultIntroduction
npc: Hello, I'm Anna Whitaker. I'm a fashion expert here to help you out.
+ What can I do for you today?
#
o_text: I'm looking for some new clothes.
o_id: trade
o_effect: StartTrading
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction
#
o_text: You keep looking at the door.
o_id: ask_duck
o_goto: DuckJob
#
o_text: Nothing, I'm good.
o_id: bye
o_goto: Exit

name: DuckJob
npc: My duck. Synthetic, white, answers to Coco. It walked out two days ago and Bob says it went down the manhole behind his store.
+ Into the sewers. With the rats. I can't go down there. 100 sat if you bring it back to me.
#
o_text: I'll find your duck.
o_id: accept_duck
o_goto: AcceptDuck
#
o_text: It's a toy. Buy a new one.
o_id: decline_duck
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: AcceptDuck
npc: Thank you. Really. The manhole is behind Bob's, east side of the street.
effect: SetFlag('JobAccepted(duck)')
#
o_text: I'll be back.
o_id: accept_bye
o_goto: Exit

name: Waiting
npc: Any sign of Coco?
#
o_text: Still looking.
o_id: still_looking
o_goto: Exit
#
o_text: It's dead. The rats got it before I did.
o_id: duck_dead
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Easy')
o_succ: BelievesDead
o_fail: DoesNotBelieve
#
o_text: Show me your clothes while I'm here.
o_id: trade_waiting
o_effect: StartTrading
o_goto: Waiting

name: HasDuck
npc: Coco! Oh, look at you. Give her here.
#
o_text: Here. One duck, slightly muddy.
o_id: give_duck
o_goto: ReturnDuck
#
o_text: Not yet. Business first.
o_id: keep_duck
o_goto: Exit
#
o_text: It's dead. The rats got it before I did.
o_id: duck_dead_lie
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Easy')
o_succ: BelievesDead
o_fail: DoesNotBelieve

name: ReturnDuck
npc: (She wipes the servos with a silk scarf that costs more than the duck.) Thank you. Here, as promised.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'synth_duck_item')
effect: PlayerAddGold(100)
effect: SetFlag('duck_returned')
#
o_text: Take care of her.
o_id: duck_thanks
o_goto: Exit

name: BelievesDead
npc: (She sits down behind the counter and does not say anything for a while.)
+ The rats. Of course. Thank you for looking. Go, please.
effect: SetFlag('told_anna_duck_dead')
effect: EndConversation

name: DoesNotBelieve
npc: The rats. (She looks at your hands, then at your face.) Bob has a new servo pack on his shelf since this morning.
+ Get out of my shop. Don't come back.
effect: SetFlag('anna_angry')
effect: EndConversation

name: Thankful
npc: Coco's keeper! She's upstairs, out of trouble. What can I do for you?
#
o_text: Show me what you have.
o_id: trade_thanks
o_effect: StartTrading
o_goto: Thankful
#
o_text: Just passing.
o_id: bye_thanks
o_goto: Exit

name: Grieving
npc: (She is dressed in black. The window display is empty.)
+ I'm not really open. Take what you need.
#
o_text: Show me what you have.
o_id: trade_grief
o_effect: StartTrading
o_goto: Grieving
#
o_text: I'm sorry.
o_id: sorry
o_goto: Exit

name: Angry
npc: I said get out.
effect: EndConversation
